      "principle": "The burden lies on the party seeking divorce to prove that the other spouse has committed cruelty.",
      "held": "It is settled law that the burden lies on the party seeking divorce to prove that the other spouse has committed cruelty. The court must be satisfied that the respondent has wilfully abandoned the appellant without reasonable justification.",
